{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_05",
  "title": "多蘿西的承諾",
  "storyCode": "DV-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "74aaa6493a13ed04666a05e9ea7975419956141be90ad4f59685ab0eea579b8d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......繆爾賽思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有料到你在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱......歉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要不是博士提醒，我差一點親手殺死你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是敵人想看見的嗎？他們想讓你變成殺害前同僚的兇手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能及時收手，除了博士出聲提醒，還有她那句話的緣故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“不要急著與任何人為敵”——她有意預告了繆爾賽思的出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這解釋了她之前的行為疑點。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她想引導我們找到繆爾賽思。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "難不成她故意把繆爾賽思送了回來？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可剛才的情況明明很兇險，誰能保證繆爾賽思不會死在我們手上......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道了，她不在乎繆爾賽思到底是死是活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這對她來說是一場測試。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......測試動力甲的技術，也測試我和羅德島的反應。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#3$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "她在酒吧裡說的每一句話都是對我的試探。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "她想讓塞雷婭加快行動。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "她仍在引導我們走向對她有利的方向。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃呃呃......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "繆爾賽思，你好些了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們在好幾個小時前給你注射了鎮定劑，你在動力甲裡面的時候已經基本恢復了清醒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你當前體驗到的暈眩與麻痺，主要是缺氧和精神恐懼帶來的後遺症。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我已經為你做了一些應急處理，但完全恢復還需要半個小時左右。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阻......阻......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阻止？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阻止......誰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是想讓我們阻止那個把你關進動力甲裡的人嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是那位黎博利嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "因為著急，繆爾賽思的額頭和手背上冒出了細密的汗珠。\n她突然抓住了你的手，伴隨著她的動作，水滴紛紛浮了起來，狠狠撞上你的衣襟。\n水在深色的布料上迅速洇開，組成了一行訊息。\n不是那個黎博利的名字，不是斐爾迪南，而是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......359。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "359號基地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你很少來這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好歹你送了我一張臨時工牌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“文獻學顧問”——萊茵這種科技公司，真的需要這方面的顧問嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你的心情很好，這是否說明，實驗進展還不錯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別提實驗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "十分鐘。像我這樣的人，一天下來，只有十分鐘是我自己的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可以把這時間花在跟孩子們打視訊電話上，也可以用這短暫的時間和埃琳娜他們一起吃個晚飯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我更喜歡什麼都不做，就站在這裡看看這一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "外面只有街道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是啊，這就是一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "像這樣工作一整天，他們必定滿身疲憊。為什麼他們的臉上看不見沮喪，腳步也依然輕快？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "因為“機會”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們相信自己的辛勞將有機會帶給全家人更好的生活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......就跟城外那些拓荒者一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "當然，就像拓荒者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "特里蒙，三馱鎮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "曾經只有三匹馱獸帶著七個拓荒者，在這片土地上建起了第一個簡陋的定居點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如今呢？看看我們腳下的街道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這裡聚集了最有活力的開拓者和開拓者們的後代。沒有哪個國家富有哥倫比亞的進取精神。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哥倫比亞的繁榮給了人們信心，而人們日復一日地不斷前進也會給哥倫比亞帶來生機。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要哥倫比亞保持飛速前進，那這片土地上每一個人的生活也都在前進。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道你們是怎麼看我的。你，克麗斯騰，塞雷婭......你們都叫我“投機者”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "能抓住機會的，可都是聰明人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "謝謝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不否認，我喜歡站在這裡，這個更高的位置，而不是下面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我配得上我得到的機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的項目帶來財富，財富推動下一個項目，技術因此而不斷進步——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們將站在其他所有國家前面，引領整個泰拉進入新的時代。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "到那個時候，後人會豎起不朽的豐碑，上面將刻有我們的名字。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "勝利屬於每一個開拓者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "十分鐘快到了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你可沒給我說話的時間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "霍爾海雅，我知道你來找我是要說什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我原諒你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "克麗斯騰，繆爾賽思，塞雷婭，帕爾維斯......還有你。我沒有時間浪費在猜測你們各自的小心思上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "多蘿西的實驗距離成功只有一步之遙——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只想要那個最後的結果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑、桑尼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "多蘿西說過了，這裡沒有危險......你們為什麼都掏出了弓弩？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒有危險？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "烏比卡博士，你錯了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在我們面前的就是最大的危險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是指......多蘿西？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我還以為你願意聽我們解釋......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "麻煩你和兩位醫生讓一讓。我們的目標從來都不是你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "埃琳娜，我們上了這位領隊先生的當。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "剛才那場被阻止的針對喬伊絲的襲擊，只是一場刻意的表演。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他先後讓我們看到了他的憤怒、他的猶豫和他的底線，只為了掩蓋一件事——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "從始至終，他都做好了真正去犯罪的準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我沒有料到邁爾會動手。為了取得你們......尤其是烏比卡博士的信任，我原本安排了薩姆來扮演更激進的一方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "算了，這些都不重要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們已經如願來到了這裡，找到了問題的源頭——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，你策劃那場綁架，又一路來到這裡，是想殺了我嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我能不能問一問......為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "依舊是溫柔到能滲進最堅硬的心臟裡的聲音。\n還有那雙濕潤的、微微睜大的眼睛。\n那麼無辜，那麼驚訝，甚至帶著一絲受傷。\n就好像該被指責的是被迫拿起武器自衛的他們一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "為什麼......你問我為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "因為我都看見了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你造出來的怪物一路追殺我們，你用我的同伴們的鮮血餵養這些怪物......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你這個......邪惡的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "並不存在什麼怪物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那些只是實驗的副產物，由一種對神經信號敏感的特殊物質構成......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......不，埃琳娜，這不是桑尼的臆測。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他的意思恐怕是，他的確早就見過那些銀色物體......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "甚至更多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "三天前，我偷偷溜進了實驗區......我想來找你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想......呃，那時候我想來問問你，我能不能報名成為受試者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "領隊，你不是說，成為受試者有很大風險，這些大公司很可能在騙我們嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "風險......哈......哈哈哈！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "對不起。薩姆，我是個言行不一致的混蛋......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可我想糾正我曾經的錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "聽著，各位——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那一夜，我看到銀色的怪物在她身邊凝聚成形，她對它們說話，就好像那是她的寵物一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "多蘿西·弗蘭克斯就是這場災難的始作俑者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "瑪麗女士，我說的這些，您是不是很難接受？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我不是喜歡看科幻電影的那類人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那或許您可以看一眼這封信。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼先生跟我巡完線之後，可能料到了之後會有危險，把這封信交給了我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他說——“萬一我出事了，請把這封信交給瑪麗·班納”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他應該不介意......您提前看到信的內容吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......給我吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "............"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#8$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "女士，信上......說了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那傢伙到底去了哪裡？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "格雷伊，你並不瞭解桑尼·羅馬諾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他的內心充滿了憤恨。因為那份該死的保險......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "又是保險......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "對，在哥倫比亞，這是個刻在所有感染者腦子裡的詞語。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "也許......很多外頭的人會覺得哥倫比亞對感染者已經足夠仁慈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“只要能支付醫療保險費用，就可以獲得後續正常生活的保障”——聽起來是不是還挺公正的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼在剛得病的時候也是這麼對我說的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是結果呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是不是一筆......非常巨額的費用？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只知道就算我當一輩子警察，不吃不喝都負擔不起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那玩意兒就不是用來保障感染者生活的......巨額保費與他們能得到的藥品完全不匹配。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那就是一筆罰款，一條隱藏的規則，用來變相逼迫感染者走上被設定好的道路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼......羅馬諾那傢伙從來不肯正視現實。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪麗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不阻止他的話，他真的有可能犯下不可饒恕的罪行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，你看到的並不是怪物，也不是我的寵物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但他們的確與我的實驗有關。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你承認了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "真相對你們而言並無益處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "知道得越多，你們就越危險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......替別人做決定，是不是你們這些上層人士最愛做的事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先放下這些利器好不好？儀器都很脆弱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或者請瞄準這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......我不介意的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她朝拓荒者們走了一步，弓弩幾乎碰到了她的身體。\n桑尼的手微微顫抖了一下，他強迫自己將視線從那雙溫和的眼睛上移開。\n這也是邪惡的伎倆，是迫使他們再次屈服的法術。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不怕死？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我怕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可我更怕你們傷害自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，你不是兇手，你的同伴們也不是。你們只是一群想過上更好生活的普通人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不是也想過參加我的實驗嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "還有機會的。只要加入我們，你就能得到你最渴望的東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我永遠不會對你們說不。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她向拓荒者們伸出了一隻手，彷彿正在等待他們握上去。\n她難道不明白，他們是來殺她的嗎？\n不能看她。她的眼睛，她的手，全都不能看。太柔軟了。\n自從不得不走上荒野，城市和城市裡的人都在冷硬地說著拒絕。\n她正在控制他們。她就是這樣控制住了那些可悲的意志軟弱的同伴。\n可是“機會”......\n這個詞語，我們有多久沒聽見了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "形狀奇特的物體",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是那些銀色造物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它們是怎麼跟過來的？我沒有看見......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......桑尼是對的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這間實驗室就是它們的誕生地......而且，你不覺得奇怪嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它們......好像在保護多蘿西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "停下來，不要傷害彼此......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "形狀奇特的物體",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它來了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "領隊，那邊還有更多！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "避開它們！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "抓住多蘿西·弗蘭克斯——不，優先攻擊這間實驗室！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只有破壞這邪惡的溫床，才能消滅掉那些怪物！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，不可以！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "桑尼，只有這件事，我不能同意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "實驗必須繼續下去——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是我對你們......對他們的承諾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
